All,

This is the announcement to begin the Last Call process for "The Printer
Working Group (PWG) Semantic Model" specification.  The Last Call will last
for 4 weeks. At the upcoming PWG Face to Face in Provo Utah we will review
and resolve all comments during the Semantic Model session. 
Please review the specification listed below and send comments to the sm
reflector (mailto:sm@pwg.org ).
 
Thanks,
Pete

The latest Semantic Model specification is now available at: 
ftp://ftp.pwg.org/pub/pwg/Semantic-Model/wd-sm10-20031031.pdf
